# Density Compare
# Holmium (Ho) — real density 8.79 g/cm³. equal masses: Holmium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Holmium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.7mm color: #a6d9ff at (-20mm, 4.8mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 70.1 g — the water cube is the reference
